<title>USA: National Patent in deal with Flour.</title>
<headline>National Patent in deal with Flour.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Patent Development Corp said Thursday its General Physics Corp unit agreed to develop the technical component of a training system for a unit of Fluor Daniel, Facility and Plant Service Inc.</p>
<p>The value of initial tasks awarded to General Physics is in excess of $6 million.</p>
<p>Under the terms of the agreement, General Physics will develop the technical training component of a work force training system designed by Fluor Daniel.</p>
<p>Fluor Daniel is a subsidiary of Fluor Corp.</p>
